            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri mwebge ntihaze haboneke umuntu atanga umwana wiwe kw ikimazi, ar’ uw’ umuhungu canke w’umukobga, ngo yoswe mu muriro, canke ngo haboneke ūragura, cank’ ūtera amabara, cank’ umupfumu, cank’ umurozi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cank’ umwābūzi, cank’ ūja guhamagara imizimu, cank’ umumenyi, cank’ ūraguza imizimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ūkora ben’ ivyo wese aba abaye umuyobe k’Uhoraho; kand’ ubgo buyobe ari bgo butumye Uhoraho Imana yanyu agira yirukane ayo mahanga imbere yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mweho muze mube abaroranye k’Uhoraho Imana yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ayo mahanga mugiye gusohora ar’ abantu bemera abatera amabara n’ abapfumu; ariko mweho, Uhoraho Imana yanyu ntiyemera ko mugenza murtyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
