        {
          "text": "Ati Nzobahagurukiriza ūvugishwa nanje ava mu b’i wabo, ameze nkawe; ati Nzoshira amajambo yanje mu kanwa kiwe, na we azobabarira ivyo ndamugeze vyose. ",
